## Clinical Co-Pilot audit-bridge public entry point.
##
## Apache does not expose the Authorization header to PHP's server vars outside
## apis/ (which carries exactly this line). Without it, the module's
## Symfony\Component\HttpFoundation\Request never sees the bearer token and
## every request fails identically. See apis/.htaccess for the canonical use.
SetEnvIf Authorization "(.*)" HTTP_AUTHORIZATION=$1
